title: recent:set-sort
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Panel types]]
kind: reference
summary: Recent: change the order (time / score)

`recent:set-sort <time|score>` orders the rows of the [[recent panel]] newest first (`time`) or best score first (`score`, [[Frecent folders]]). The choice is kept in the workspace variable `recent:sort`. Asked without a value, the question offers the other order, so <<key "recent:set-sort" "v s">> then `Enter` switches.
